s:\n\n- `Parse Error: Expected '['`\n\nI have found an older mention of the same problem https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/85948#issuecomment-1865004589\n\nJetBrains Rider has a setting for newly created files, maybe other external editors have the same too.\nAlso repored in Rider issue tracker https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/RIDER-138957\n\n<img width=\"1003\" height=\"736\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/749832de-2a65-4b3e-9642-8f130b57b91f\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a valid .tscn file.\nChange the encoding of the file to UTF-8 with BOM.\nTry to open the project or load the scene in Godot.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n-","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119562/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119562/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}